@startuml
actor MerchantApp as "Merchant Application"
participant API as "Payment Provider API (Emulator)"
database DB as "Payment Provider DB"
participant ExtNet as "External Test Service"
=== Transaction ==
MerchantApp -> API: POST /api/v1/transactions (Basic Auth)
activate API
  API -> API: Authenticate merchant
  API -> API: Validate request data
  API -> DB: INSERT into transactions (status=PENDING)
  API <-- DB: new transaction record (ID)
  API -> MerchantApp: 201 Created (status=PENDING)
deactivate API

=== Async later ==

ExtNet -> API: POST /webhook/transaction ({id, status="SUCCESS|FAILED"})

activate API
    API -> API: Validate payload
    alt payload invalid
    API --> ExtNet: Http status (401)
    end
    loop Retry up to 3 times
        API -> DB: UPDATE transaction.status = SUCCESS|FAILED
        API -> DB: INSERT into webhooks (entity_id, payload)
    end
    alt success
        API --> ExtNet: HTTP status (200)
    else  After 3 failed attempts
        API --> ExtNet: HTTP status (503)
    end
deactivate API
@enduml